Krita Nova 78 - Move tool: "Move and select layer with content"

A fourth Selection Mode in the Move tool options. Like "Move layer with
content" it moves the first layer with visible content under the cursor,
and it also makes that layer the active layer in the Layers docker (like
Photoshop's Auto-Select). The layer is picked when the drag (or click)
starts, inside the isolated group if isolation is on; with an active
selection the current layer is kept, since the move then works on the
selected pixels. Saved in kritarc [KritaTransform/KisToolMove]
novaSelectPickedLayer. The mode radio buttons now only react when checked.

